WEBVTT

01:35.820 --> 01:40.770
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.750 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 20]

01:46.350 --> 01:47.610
The person who took Ruyan's carriage

01:47.610 --> 01:48.840
to meet Xia Jingshi

01:49.840 --> 01:52.300
was actually
in the Murong Marquis mansion.

01:53.039 --> 01:54.840
The benefactor Ruyan mentioned

01:56.070 --> 01:57.600
turned out to be Murong Yao.

02:23.910 --> 02:24.470
Let's go.

02:40.110 --> 02:41.310
You're letting me go?

02:42.000 --> 02:42.470
Yes.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.030
Why?

02:45.190 --> 02:45.960
I've already found out

02:45.960 --> 02:47.690
who that Meng Junran really is.

02:48.120 --> 02:48.870
Impossible.

02:50.870 --> 02:52.470
The Murong Marquis mansion.

02:53.630 --> 02:54.240
Do you need me

02:54.240 --> 02:55.370
to be more specific?

02:58.079 --> 02:59.740
You're deeply devoted to him.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.360
But he didn't even bother to find out

03:01.360 --> 03:02.760
if you betrayed him or not

03:02.800 --> 03:04.800
before sending someone to kill you.

03:05.430 --> 03:06.830
It shows that in his heart

03:06.910 --> 03:07.560
you're just

03:07.560 --> 03:09.220
an insignificant character.

03:10.990 --> 03:12.000
After all this,

03:12.470 --> 03:13.310
you should see

03:13.310 --> 03:14.640
his true colours by now.

03:14.800 --> 03:15.310
He doesn't deserve

03:15.310 --> 03:16.640
any of your attachment.

03:17.190 --> 03:19.050
Don't talk about dying so easily.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.520
Live well.

03:21.430 --> 03:22.590
After you leave this place,

03:22.590 --> 03:24.050
you'll still be in danger.

03:24.240 --> 03:26.520
He will surely send people
to hunt you down.

03:26.520 --> 03:27.500
Don't go back to the dance house.

03:27.500 --> 03:28.900
Don't look for him again.

03:33.600 --> 03:34.750
Leave Yujing City

03:35.470 --> 03:36.600
and start a new life.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.520
Before I change my mind,

03:42.800 --> 03:43.930
you'd better leave.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.079
Hurry and leave!

04:13.400 --> 04:14.150
Feng Suige asked you

04:14.150 --> 04:15.880
about the escort agency today?

04:15.960 --> 04:17.480
As you instructed before,

04:17.600 --> 04:19.930
I said it was commissioned by Manager Luo.

04:20.070 --> 04:21.870
Manager Luo's lead is a dead end.

04:21.870 --> 04:23.330
He can't answer anything.

04:25.380 --> 04:27.000
Your Lordship, you been tired all day.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.720
May I massage your legs?

04:32.330 --> 04:33.190
No need.

04:34.270 --> 04:35.220
All these years,

04:35.310 --> 04:37.240
you've never asked what I want to do

04:37.310 --> 04:38.370
or what I wish to do.

04:38.800 --> 04:39.930
Aren't you curious?

04:41.480 --> 04:43.240
No matter what Your Lordship wants to do

04:43.240 --> 04:44.100
or wishes to do,

04:44.750 --> 04:45.720
I will

04:45.720 --> 04:47.180
forever stay by your side.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.160
Young Master,

05:08.160 --> 05:09.240
don't go!

05:11.270 --> 05:12.480
All right.

05:12.560 --> 05:14.290
Let me see what we'll eat later.

05:14.630 --> 05:15.270
Stop looking.

05:15.270 --> 05:16.270
-Let's go there.
-Let's go there.

05:16.270 --> 05:16.800
Go.

05:16.800 --> 05:18.130
-Okay.
-Go there. Okay.

05:18.240 --> 05:18.830
Hurry!

05:42.340 --> 05:43.070
Someone's coming.

05:43.070 --> 05:43.600
Retreat!

06:28.240 --> 06:29.310
You want to die?

06:30.190 --> 06:31.310
It's not that easy.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.120
Feng Suige.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.870
Don't be happy too soon.

06:35.750 --> 06:36.750
Your doomsday

06:37.040 --> 06:38.070
is coming.

06:38.700 --> 06:40.430
How come the mighty death camp.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.240
only

06:42.680 --> 06:44.360
have this few people?

07:00.750 --> 07:01.430
Take them away.

07:01.430 --> 07:02.120
-Yes.
-Yes.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.220
Your Highness.

07:11.310 --> 07:12.360
I've checked the surroundings

07:12.360 --> 07:14.090
and found nothing suspicious.

07:19.180 --> 07:21.720
[Wutong Mansion]

07:32.340 --> 07:33.200
Your Highness.

07:34.480 --> 07:35.840
Let's use every torture device we have.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.170
She'll surely confess.

07:41.630 --> 07:42.360
Wake her up.

07:44.190 --> 07:44.850
Salt water.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.560
The Minister of War of Susha

08:02.000 --> 08:04.200
had no grudges against your death camp.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.260
You killed him

08:06.510 --> 08:07.600
just for him

08:07.630 --> 08:09.560
to be a scapegoat and shield.

08:09.800 --> 08:11.330
Everyone at court knows

08:11.360 --> 08:12.720
Hou Jing is my man.

08:13.240 --> 08:14.360
If something happens to him,

08:14.360 --> 08:16.160
I'll be isolated at court.

08:16.190 --> 08:17.830
The position of Minister of War

08:17.830 --> 08:18.830
will be vacant.

08:19.070 --> 08:20.190
Your master

08:21.070 --> 08:24.130
can then seize the opportunity
to appoint someone new.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.760
The affairs of Susha's court

08:28.310 --> 08:29.770
have nothing to do with me.

08:35.320 --> 08:37.549
So Zhuang Shen sent you, did he?

08:39.080 --> 08:40.320
Kill me if you want.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.090
Stop wasting time.

08:52.150 --> 08:52.960
I wonder.

08:53.510 --> 08:54.870
You can withstand them,

08:55.600 --> 08:57.840
but can your subordinates withstand

08:57.960 --> 08:59.290
these tortures of mine?

09:05.910 --> 09:06.770
Your Highness.

09:08.320 --> 09:09.120
He confessed?

09:09.240 --> 09:09.900
Yes, he did.

09:10.200 --> 09:10.960
I thought that man

09:10.960 --> 09:12.120
would be tough to break.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.850
But as soon as the nails went in,

09:13.870 --> 09:15.330
he confessed everything.

09:35.150 --> 09:36.030
He's dead?

09:36.360 --> 09:37.840
He kept muttering from the moment
we brought them in,

09:37.840 --> 09:38.840
like he was chanting a spell.

09:38.840 --> 09:40.060
Your Highness, I feel these people

09:40.060 --> 09:41.120
are all a bit mentally unstable.

09:41.120 --> 09:42.670
I'm asking how he died.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.750
He confessed after just a brief beating.

09:44.750 --> 09:45.510
Said it was someone

09:45.510 --> 09:47.030
named Meng Junran who gave the order.

09:47.030 --> 09:47.600
"Your Eminence"

09:47.600 --> 09:48.790
instructed before leaving Yujing

09:48.790 --> 09:50.550
to obey everything Meng Junran says.

09:50.550 --> 09:51.550
"Your Eminence"?

09:51.720 --> 09:52.850
That's Xia Jingshi.

09:53.510 --> 09:55.150
I thought we were getting somewhere,

09:55.150 --> 09:56.000
but this guy

09:56.030 --> 09:56.890
was just trying

09:56.960 --> 09:58.960
to mislead me even when confessing.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.120
When I wasn't looking,

10:00.120 --> 10:01.440
he smashed his head and died.

10:01.440 --> 10:02.750
The more I hear, the more I think

10:02.750 --> 10:03.510
this death camp is complicated.

10:03.510 --> 10:04.000
These assassins

10:04.000 --> 10:05.320
have been trained to be inhuman.

10:05.320 --> 10:07.120
They're completely heartless.

10:09.790 --> 10:10.790
Where's the body?

10:10.960 --> 10:11.960
Still in the cell.

10:32.290 --> 10:35.140
♪ Arrows skim through fleeting light ♪

10:35.570 --> 10:38.050
♪ In the blink of an eye ♪

10:38.510 --> 10:41.430
♪ Scattering among clouds and mist ♪

10:44.570 --> 10:46.970
♪ I fall off a cliff ♪

10:47.410 --> 10:49.780
♪ My wings, in an instant ♪

10:50.320 --> 10:53.560
♪ Shatter into sand ♪

10:53.850 --> 10:57.650
♪ Who once smiled
in the face of the frost? ♪

11:02.000 --> 11:02.990
Why is it you?

11:03.150 --> 11:04.320
I've been following you

11:04.320 --> 11:04.870
just to see

11:04.870 --> 11:06.000
how you would leave.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.030
I didn't think you would

11:07.030 --> 11:08.600
still go to Murong Marquis's mansion.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.480
What's more surprising is

11:09.480 --> 11:11.540
that you wanted to take your own life.

11:13.450 --> 11:14.550
Why did you save me?

11:15.170 --> 11:16.420
Wouldn't it be better to let me die?

11:16.420 --> 11:17.360
Die for him?

11:17.550 --> 11:18.350
Is it worth it?

11:18.910 --> 11:20.310
If you jump from here now,

11:20.480 --> 11:21.200
tomorrow Yujing City

11:21.200 --> 11:22.510
will just have one more floating corpse.

11:22.510 --> 11:23.970
Nothing else will change.

11:24.030 --> 11:24.870
In his heart,

11:24.960 --> 11:26.200
you're already dead.

11:32.000 --> 11:32.720
Dead...

11:32.910 --> 11:33.440
Actually, that day

11:33.440 --> 11:35.000
when I tracked you
to Murong Marquis's mansion,

11:35.000 --> 11:35.720
I already knew

11:35.720 --> 11:36.850
Meng Junran was him.

11:37.510 --> 11:38.270
I just hoped

11:38.270 --> 11:38.910
to hear you

11:38.960 --> 11:39.840
say his name.

11:40.600 --> 11:41.600
Because only then

11:41.910 --> 11:42.970
could it prove that

11:43.000 --> 11:44.460
you had already let him go.

11:46.840 --> 11:47.440
I'm not someone

11:47.440 --> 11:49.080
who meddles in others' affairs.

11:49.080 --> 11:51.000
It's only because
we share similar experiences.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.660
The suffering I once endured,

11:53.080 --> 11:53.720
I don't want it

11:53.720 --> 11:54.840
to happen to you.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.000
I just don't understand.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.960
How could someone I'd rather die

12:00.960 --> 12:02.320
than to betray

12:04.600 --> 12:06.200
be so cruel to me?

12:09.600 --> 12:11.400
His heartlessness is his fault.

12:11.790 --> 12:13.320
Don't blame it on yourself.

12:14.510 --> 12:15.440
But is the reason you'd rather die

12:15.440 --> 12:16.400
than betray him

12:17.390 --> 12:19.590
just because you have feelings for him?

12:20.320 --> 12:21.520
If it weren't for him,

12:22.790 --> 12:24.320
I wouldn't be alive today.

12:25.870 --> 12:27.400
I grew up in the dance house.

12:28.030 --> 12:29.930
Since young, I had to suffer
countless hardships

12:29.930 --> 12:31.590
and endur countless beatings

12:31.870 --> 12:33.930
to become the top dancer in the house.

12:35.270 --> 12:37.870
At the same time,
I became my mother's cash cow.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.240
You have to entertain clients.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.840
I despised that life.

12:45.910 --> 12:47.710
But I couldn't change anything.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.030
Just when I had lost all hope

12:50.030 --> 12:52.030
and wished to end my life,

12:53.910 --> 12:54.630
he came.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.880
He was like a beam of light

12:58.290 --> 12:59.270
shining upon me.

13:00.870 --> 13:01.480
Later,

13:03.080 --> 13:04.480
he gave me the dance house

13:05.910 --> 13:07.630
and made me its owner.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.390
He saved you.

13:10.310 --> 13:13.030
Your unwillingness to betray him
even at the cost of your life

13:13.030 --> 13:14.160
is understandable.

13:14.480 --> 13:15.540
At the dance house,

13:16.030 --> 13:16.630
I helped him collect

13:16.630 --> 13:18.830
intelligence on officials and nobles.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.200
You know what?

13:21.670 --> 13:22.870
Everyone saw me as

13:22.910 --> 13:23.970
a lowly dancer.

13:24.660 --> 13:25.600
Only he

13:26.630 --> 13:28.630
never looked down on my background.

13:29.360 --> 13:30.890
Whatever debt you owed him,

13:31.200 --> 13:32.790
it was cleared

13:32.840 --> 13:34.550
the moment he sent someone to kill you.

13:34.550 --> 13:35.390
From now on,

13:36.750 --> 13:37.810
live for yourself.

13:39.510 --> 13:40.720
Live for myself?

14:26.620 --> 14:28.200
Who is this Meng Junran?

14:41.030 --> 14:43.230
Your Eminence told you to listen to him.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.140
You can't possibly not know

14:45.140 --> 14:46.140
who he is, can you?

14:46.630 --> 14:47.770
I don't know.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.150
Then it seems your subordinates

14:50.150 --> 14:51.130
were right.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.790
Prime Minister Zhuang these days

14:52.790 --> 14:54.520
has been staying in the palace.

14:54.790 --> 14:56.260
So he couldn't have had the chance

14:56.260 --> 14:57.670
to give you orders.

14:58.240 --> 14:59.900
So it must be this Meng Junran.

15:01.240 --> 15:02.550
Tell me his identity.

15:03.030 --> 15:04.240
I can spare your life.

15:07.080 --> 15:07.550
Why?

15:08.840 --> 15:10.040
You don't believe me?

15:10.870 --> 15:12.270
Members of the death camp

15:13.270 --> 15:14.550
never betray.

15:15.510 --> 15:17.550
Because death for them

15:18.440 --> 15:20.630
is an extreme luxury.

15:21.870 --> 15:23.080
Without permission,

15:23.510 --> 15:25.240
taking one's own life

15:25.720 --> 15:27.780
means no reincarnation after death.

15:28.360 --> 15:31.030
When captured by enemies,
to prove loyalty,

15:31.440 --> 15:33.390
only suicide brings release.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.550
You think these little tricks

15:36.550 --> 15:37.790
can fool me?

15:39.720 --> 15:40.910
I truly don't know

15:40.960 --> 15:42.290
Meng Junran's identity

15:43.120 --> 15:44.080
As for the reason

15:44.080 --> 15:46.440
why His Eminence sent us
to complete this mission

15:46.440 --> 15:47.720
or what his plans are,

15:48.630 --> 15:50.630
we're merely following orders.

15:51.390 --> 15:52.520
These are the rules.

15:53.510 --> 15:54.670
People from the death camp

15:54.670 --> 15:56.000
understand rules best.

16:00.910 --> 16:01.600
However,

16:02.960 --> 16:04.600
I have something else

16:04.720 --> 16:05.720
to tell you.

16:07.440 --> 16:10.240
You'll find it very interesting.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.390
Go on.

16:15.390 --> 16:16.390
Once,

16:17.480 --> 16:19.000
there was a little girl.

16:19.600 --> 16:21.120
When I first saw her,

16:21.510 --> 16:23.360
she was like a little stray dog.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.630
I only needed one flatbread

16:25.630 --> 16:26.600
to lure her back to

16:26.600 --> 16:28.110
my death camp

16:29.600 --> 16:30.740
All these years,

16:31.200 --> 16:32.750
I often dream of her,

16:33.510 --> 16:34.870
dream of all the moments

16:34.870 --> 16:37.080
we spent together.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.550
She was so tiny.

16:39.910 --> 16:41.360
All covered in blood.

16:41.750 --> 16:42.870
She would kneel down

16:42.870 --> 16:44.200
and kowtow to me saying,

16:44.840 --> 16:45.630
"I'm sorry.

16:46.150 --> 16:47.000
I'm sorry."

16:51.670 --> 16:52.440
But she

16:53.440 --> 16:55.700
should be grateful to me, shouldn't she?

16:55.870 --> 16:57.320
Without me,

16:57.670 --> 16:59.740
how could she have
such great martial skills now?

16:59.740 --> 17:00.480
People can only

17:00.480 --> 17:01.670
unleash their unlimited potential

17:01.670 --> 17:03.440
when they're close to death.

17:03.510 --> 17:05.000
I would hold her underwater

17:05.000 --> 17:06.270
and then save her.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.440
Breath control.

17:09.790 --> 17:11.270
What a master archer needs most

17:11.270 --> 17:12.329
is breath control.

17:13.000 --> 17:15.369
Without proper breath control and focus,

17:15.790 --> 17:17.849
how could she ever shoot accurately?

17:18.069 --> 17:20.400
How could she become the deadliest arrow?

17:22.310 --> 17:23.440
Then,

17:24.400 --> 17:26.900
I locked her in the cellar.

17:29.550 --> 17:30.440
Do you know

17:30.640 --> 17:33.240
what total darkness is like?

17:34.640 --> 17:37.080
She didn't see the sun for six months.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.720
During those six months,

17:38.720 --> 17:41.300
if a few rats got in,

17:41.570 --> 17:44.110
she would be deeply grateful to me.

17:44.610 --> 17:45.670
There was no sound.

17:46.590 --> 17:47.480
No sound.

17:48.480 --> 17:50.660
Not a single sound.

17:53.310 --> 17:54.820
Your Highness,

17:56.400 --> 17:58.510
do you know who I'm talking about?

18:26.310 --> 18:27.650
You think angering me

18:27.680 --> 18:29.200
will make me kill you?

18:29.830 --> 18:30.830
When it comes to tactics,

18:30.830 --> 18:32.920
you may be even more ruthless

18:32.940 --> 18:34.110
and cruel than I am.

18:34.310 --> 18:35.350
You also know better than anyone

18:35.350 --> 18:36.480
what kind of torture

18:36.510 --> 18:38.400
awaits you.

18:39.200 --> 18:41.480
So you want to end it all,

18:42.550 --> 18:44.750
thinking you can escape the suffering.

18:49.830 --> 18:52.790
You even try to end your life
by biting your tongue off.

18:52.790 --> 18:54.670
But I won't let you have your way.

18:56.440 --> 18:58.270
I'll make you regret

18:58.270 --> 19:00.230
ever being born.

19:36.750 --> 19:38.030
The Junior Marquis of Changle

19:38.030 --> 19:39.720
is His Highness' childhood friend.

19:39.720 --> 19:41.650
They're as close as real brothers.

19:46.030 --> 19:47.610
And the old nursemaid

19:48.510 --> 19:50.440
who'd been with me since I was born.

19:51.070 --> 19:52.700
To win favor with my enemy,

19:52.880 --> 19:54.000
she tried

19:54.510 --> 19:56.270
to burn me alive in my sleep.

19:57.510 --> 19:59.440
Even my childhood study companion

19:59.440 --> 20:01.170
And my swordsmanship teacher…

20:01.400 --> 20:03.350
They all used my trust

20:03.480 --> 20:04.550
and tried every possible way

20:04.550 --> 20:05.960
to kill me.

20:08.750 --> 20:09.750
If you knew that

20:10.310 --> 20:11.510
even your close friend of many years

20:11.510 --> 20:12.510
had betrayed you,

20:13.810 --> 20:15.270
how painful would that be?

20:46.480 --> 20:47.340
Your Highness.

20:47.480 --> 20:49.070
This is the inner palace garden.

20:49.070 --> 20:50.130
Outside officials

20:50.440 --> 20:51.840
are not allowed to enter.

20:52.830 --> 20:54.430
Wait outside with Princess.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.440
I'll go meet the Empress Dowager.

20:56.440 --> 20:57.070
Your Highness,

20:57.070 --> 20:58.070
we've entered the palace.

20:58.070 --> 20:59.350
Instead of greeting the Emperor first,

20:59.350 --> 21:01.070
we are meeting the Empress Dowager?

21:01.070 --> 21:03.240
Let me meet the Empress Dowager with you.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.240
If she gives you trouble,

21:04.240 --> 21:05.440
I'll explain for you.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.640
It's good for Her Highness to come along.

21:07.640 --> 21:09.720
After all, leaving Susha
without permission

21:09.720 --> 21:11.180
requires an explanation.

21:11.880 --> 21:13.240
I can explain to her clearly

21:13.240 --> 21:15.040
why both of us had to leave Susha.

21:16.880 --> 21:18.680
When we meet the Empress Dowager,

21:18.680 --> 21:19.680
whatever she asks you,

21:19.680 --> 21:21.000
just answer truthfully.

21:21.000 --> 21:21.730
Don't worry.

21:27.940 --> 21:31.290
[Shunde Palace]

21:38.550 --> 21:39.350
Your Majesty,

21:39.400 --> 21:42.060
the Prince of Zhennan and his wife
have arrived.

21:43.400 --> 21:44.490
You may leave.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.810
I pay my respects, Mother.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.400
Rise.

22:03.110 --> 22:04.170
Thank you, Mother.

22:07.270 --> 22:09.270
So this is your new wife,

22:09.590 --> 22:10.850
the Princess of Susha?

22:11.880 --> 22:13.680
Since the Emperor promised Susha

22:13.680 --> 22:15.680
that you would be their son-in-law,

22:15.680 --> 22:18.210
why did you disobey
and return to the capital?

22:18.270 --> 22:19.320
You even brought

22:19.350 --> 22:21.080
the Princess of Susha with you.

22:21.110 --> 22:22.920
Our countries have just made peace.

22:22.920 --> 22:24.650
Are you trying to provoke a war?

22:25.400 --> 22:27.550
As the Commander-in-Chief of Zhennan Pass,

22:27.550 --> 22:29.270
if I were detained in Susha indefinitely,

22:29.270 --> 22:30.070
I fear the Zhennan Army

22:30.070 --> 22:32.270
would lose morale and fighting spirit.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.590
I risked my life to return

22:33.590 --> 22:34.650
was all for Jinxiu,

22:35.400 --> 22:36.370
So you're saying

22:36.440 --> 22:38.350
that sending you to Susha as a son-in-law

22:38.350 --> 22:40.070
was a mistake by the Emperor and me?

22:40.070 --> 22:40.710
Mother,

22:41.310 --> 22:42.390
I never meant that.

22:44.110 --> 22:45.460
You've grown bolder

22:45.880 --> 22:47.680
and making your own decisions now.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.440
You dare to disobey

22:48.440 --> 22:49.770
both me and the Emperor.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.130
I wouldn't dare.

22:51.310 --> 22:52.590
I wouldn't dare to defy

22:52.590 --> 22:54.790
your or His Majesty's wishes in any way.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.830
Please understand, Your Highness.

22:56.830 --> 22:58.830
All these years the Prince of Zhennan
spent in Pingling City,

22:58.830 --> 22:59.680
he dedicated every thought

22:59.680 --> 23:01.590
to defending the borders
and protecting the country.

23:01.590 --> 23:03.590
He has no selfish intentions whatsoever.

23:03.590 --> 23:04.830
These words coming

23:04.850 --> 23:06.880
from an enemy princess's mouth.

23:07.770 --> 23:09.570
How can I possibly believe them?

23:09.720 --> 23:10.930
If it weren't true,

23:11.070 --> 23:11.960
I wouldn't have willingly

23:11.960 --> 23:13.440
angered my father and brothers

23:13.440 --> 23:14.200
just to help the Prince of Zhennan

23:14.200 --> 23:15.250
return to Jinxiu.

23:17.110 --> 23:18.030
So you're saying

23:18.030 --> 23:19.030
I should thank you

23:19.030 --> 23:20.430
for your righteousness?

23:22.510 --> 23:23.480
You, leave.

23:24.070 --> 23:25.130
I need to speak

23:25.160 --> 23:26.560
with your husband alone.

23:48.270 --> 23:50.870
Back then, to escape from Jinxiu,

23:50.960 --> 23:52.750
you called me Mother.

23:53.270 --> 23:55.760
Now, to escape from Susha,

23:55.960 --> 23:57.440
you didn't hesitate to bring

23:57.440 --> 23:59.030
that enemy princess with you.

23:59.030 --> 24:00.240
Have you figured out how to explain this

24:00.240 --> 24:01.750
to your Red-Clad General?

24:04.030 --> 24:04.550
What?

24:05.790 --> 24:06.550
You don't actually think

24:06.550 --> 24:08.480
I don't know what you've been doing

24:08.680 --> 24:10.080
in Pingling City, do you?

24:12.720 --> 24:13.480
These years,

24:13.480 --> 24:15.210
you've done well at the border.

24:15.920 --> 24:17.200
Pingling City has been governed

24:17.200 --> 24:19.200
with perfect order under your rule.

24:19.310 --> 24:20.980
The several invasions from Susha

24:20.980 --> 24:22.440
were also repelled by you.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.290
Now throughout the court,

24:24.350 --> 24:27.550
who doesn't know the reputation
of the Prince of Zhennan?

24:29.110 --> 24:31.510
It's all thanks to your nurturing, Mother.

24:32.750 --> 24:35.030
You also have the blood
of the late emperor.

24:35.030 --> 24:36.720
You're Jinxiu's only Prince.

24:37.750 --> 24:39.410
The Emperor is a carefree man.

24:42.270 --> 24:43.790
Jinxiu's grand affairs

24:44.400 --> 24:46.130
shall rely on you in the future.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.720
Don't let

24:49.720 --> 24:51.240
my nurturing go to waste.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.470
Has someone wronged you?

25:15.550 --> 25:17.010
Tell me who bullied you.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.840
I'll make them regret it.

25:19.030 --> 25:19.640
Remember,

25:20.200 --> 25:22.800
after you're married,
no matter what happens,

25:23.000 --> 25:24.520
you must let Father know.

25:25.000 --> 25:27.230
I'll always be your support.

25:27.680 --> 25:28.860
The entire Susha

25:28.960 --> 25:30.180
is your backing.

25:29.050 --> 25:30.800
♪ Roaming freely ♪

25:30.240 --> 25:30.720
Xiyang,

25:31.360 --> 25:34.900
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

25:31.480 --> 25:32.940
as long as you can be happy,

25:33.350 --> 25:34.610
I can accept anything.

25:35.070 --> 25:36.240
Because more than anyone else

25:36.240 --> 25:37.200
in this world,

25:36.560 --> 25:38.390
♪ The wet wings ♪

25:37.510 --> 25:39.030
I want you to be happy.

25:38.620 --> 25:42.470
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

25:46.080 --> 25:49.590
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

25:52.480 --> 25:56.240
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

25:59.350 --> 26:00.000
Who is this?

26:00.000 --> 26:02.060
Dare to not kneel before His Majesty?

26:05.270 --> 26:06.220
Who are you?

26:06.400 --> 26:07.330
Raise your head.

26:15.110 --> 26:15.910
Your Majesty.

26:16.110 --> 26:17.720
This is the wife of the Prince of Zhennan.

26:17.720 --> 26:19.850
Xiyang pays respects to Your Majesty.

26:20.400 --> 26:21.310
Well, well,

26:21.960 --> 26:23.420
Xia Jingshi has returned.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.310
You have the nerve to come back?

26:34.310 --> 26:34.790
Stop!

26:37.240 --> 26:38.000
Stop!

26:39.000 --> 26:40.600
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

26:43.240 --> 26:44.040
Your Majesty.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.700
What are you doing?

26:47.030 --> 26:48.230
I'm going to kill him.

26:48.510 --> 26:49.070
Your Majesty!

26:49.070 --> 26:49.830
You absolutely cannot!

26:49.830 --> 26:50.400
You must not!

26:50.400 --> 26:51.330
Get out of my way!

26:51.790 --> 26:52.300
Enough!

26:52.510 --> 26:53.640
Stop this nonsense.

26:55.070 --> 26:56.800
Your brother has just returned

26:57.110 --> 26:59.110
and you're already threatening
to kill him.

26:59.110 --> 27:01.070
How would this look if word got out?

27:01.830 --> 27:03.350
If he has done something wrong,

27:03.350 --> 27:05.150
you should address it properly.

27:05.200 --> 27:06.790
Let him admit the wrongs himself.

27:06.790 --> 27:08.110
The royal family's dignity

27:08.110 --> 27:10.240
has been completely disgraced by you.

27:14.440 --> 27:14.920
Mother.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.720
I made my own decision

27:16.720 --> 27:18.200
to leave Susha without permission

27:18.200 --> 27:19.750
because I was forced by circumstances.

27:19.750 --> 27:21.550
I couldn't report to you in time.

27:21.750 --> 27:23.030
But everything I've done

27:23.030 --> 27:24.030
was for Jinxiu,

27:25.110 --> 27:26.310
and for Your Majesty.

27:27.000 --> 27:28.480
I had no selfish intentions.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.730
Stop pretending.

27:30.680 --> 27:31.830
A lowborn like you

27:32.550 --> 27:33.720
dares to stand before Mother

27:33.720 --> 27:35.180
and call yourself her son?

27:35.350 --> 27:36.210
Let me tell you,

27:36.480 --> 27:37.910
killing you now

27:38.240 --> 27:39.900
would be like crushing an ant.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.310
Enough of this.

27:47.950 --> 27:49.590
Prince of Zhennan, you've come from afar.

27:49.590 --> 27:50.350
I assume you haven't arranged

27:50.350 --> 27:51.590
your accommodations yet.

27:51.590 --> 27:52.570
In my opinion,

27:53.000 --> 27:55.800
he should stay at the Rongyang Palace
in the north.

27:56.750 --> 27:57.550
Bai Shouzhuo,

27:57.830 --> 27:58.890
escort them there.

28:00.160 --> 28:01.220
Yes, Your Majesty.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.820
Please follow me, both of you.

28:06.720 --> 28:08.120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.090
Mother,

28:10.510 --> 28:11.910
I shall take my leave now.

28:14.880 --> 28:15.480
Please.

28:25.920 --> 28:26.920
Prime Minister.

28:27.920 --> 28:30.880
Minister Hou has been seriously wounded
in an assassination attempt.

28:30.880 --> 28:32.590
The Ministry of War is now leaderless

28:32.590 --> 28:33.750
and is in complete disarray.

28:33.750 --> 28:35.030
What should we do?

28:37.590 --> 28:38.880
Prime Minister Zhuang.

28:38.880 --> 28:40.110
The most urgent matter now

28:40.110 --> 28:41.920
is to immediately select an official

28:41.920 --> 28:43.390
to replace the Minister.

28:43.790 --> 28:44.630
Censor Wang,

28:44.680 --> 28:45.940
who do you have in mind?

28:46.350 --> 28:47.790
Liu Qin, the Vice Minister of War.

28:47.790 --> 28:49.680
He has served as Deputy Minister
for over five years

28:49.680 --> 28:51.270
without making any mistakes.

28:51.270 --> 28:53.070
Having him replace the Minister

28:53.240 --> 28:54.770
would be most appropriate.

28:55.160 --> 28:57.050
I recommend the official
from the Minister of War,

28:57.050 --> 28:58.150
Zhao Zhongxian.

28:58.440 --> 29:00.480
Lord Zhao is well-versed in state affairs,

29:00.480 --> 29:01.510
skilled in both civil
and military matters.

29:01.510 --> 29:03.720
Your Majesty has praised him many times.

29:03.720 --> 29:05.780
He is truly a talent worth employing.

29:06.030 --> 29:08.150
Lord Zhao is indeed talented,

29:08.270 --> 29:09.560
but he is quite young.

29:10.000 --> 29:11.960
If we appoint him as the Minister,

29:12.070 --> 29:14.310
I fear others may not accept
his authority.

29:14.310 --> 29:16.960
How about Minister Li Rongshi
from the Ministry of Works?

29:16.960 --> 29:19.010
He could transfer from Works to War.

29:19.110 --> 29:20.310
That would be acceptable.

29:20.310 --> 29:22.200
Indeed, Minister Li would be
more suitable.

29:22.200 --> 29:24.680
But Deputy Minister Liu is more familiar

29:24.830 --> 29:27.030
with the affairs of the Ministry of War.

29:28.440 --> 29:29.600
I have heard

29:29.680 --> 29:30.850
what you all said.

29:31.590 --> 29:32.990
I need to think carefully

29:33.000 --> 29:34.840
about these three candidates.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.030
Father.

29:57.200 --> 29:58.960
Whether it's Left Vice Minister Liu Qin,

29:58.960 --> 30:00.610
physician Zhao Zhongxian,

30:00.720 --> 30:01.910
or Li Rongshi,

30:02.030 --> 30:03.360
they are all our people.

30:04.680 --> 30:05.740
How is His Majesty?

30:07.790 --> 30:08.590
I don't know when

30:08.590 --> 30:09.450
he will wake up.

30:13.240 --> 30:14.590
You ordered him back

30:14.790 --> 30:15.920
just to kill him?

30:16.400 --> 30:17.540
I don't care.

30:17.960 --> 30:19.680
I feel disgusted just looking at him.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.140
I want to kill him on sight.

30:21.160 --> 30:22.270
Anyway, Mother

30:22.830 --> 30:24.350
won't let me actually do it,

30:24.350 --> 30:24.920
right?

30:25.200 --> 30:26.790
Stop causing me trouble.

30:27.030 --> 30:27.790
He now commands

30:27.790 --> 30:28.990
over 100,000 troops.

30:29.130 --> 30:30.660
If anything happens to him,

30:30.750 --> 30:31.790
the army from Pingling City

30:31.790 --> 30:32.920
will storm the capital.

30:32.920 --> 30:33.960
I should have killed

30:33.960 --> 30:34.790
that bastard back then.

30:34.790 --> 30:35.710
It was you.

30:35.960 --> 30:37.110
You were bewitched by his constant calls

30:37.110 --> 30:38.480
of 'Mother' and lost all senses.

30:38.480 --> 30:40.160
You insisted on letting him go.

30:40.160 --> 30:41.090
All these years,

30:41.400 --> 30:42.750
he's been fighting wars and gaining merit.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.640
I've been mocked

30:43.640 --> 30:45.500
as just a capital-bound emperor.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.610
Now you fear him

30:48.270 --> 30:50.200
and think I'm causing you trouble?

30:50.880 --> 30:52.070
He is a bastard.

30:52.790 --> 30:54.350
You are my true son.

30:55.000 --> 30:56.400
But you are incompetent!

30:57.480 --> 30:57.880
I...

30:58.400 --> 31:00.260
If you want to secure your throne,

31:00.400 --> 31:01.920
if you want to spend your days
in debauchery

31:01.920 --> 31:02.960
and do whatever you please,

31:02.960 --> 31:04.800
you must rely on Xia Jingshi.

31:05.680 --> 31:06.930
With him here,

31:07.000 --> 31:08.680
Zhennan Pass will remain secure.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.680
Those old ministers at court

31:09.680 --> 31:11.260
won't dare to make trouble.

31:11.680 --> 31:13.080
He does have the ability,

31:13.830 --> 31:15.030
but he lacks loyalty.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.280
He may look like a dog now,

31:17.400 --> 31:18.030
but did you see

31:18.030 --> 31:19.510
that look in his eyes just now?

31:19.510 --> 31:20.930
He's a wolf cub.

31:21.110 --> 31:22.710
He will bite sooner or later.

31:23.960 --> 31:25.960
I naturally have ways to control him

31:26.640 --> 31:28.030
and make him bow

31:28.200 --> 31:29.400
to us, mother and son.

31:35.880 --> 31:36.880
This way, please.

31:42.970 --> 31:48.160
[Rongyang Palace]

31:47.160 --> 31:48.790
This place is different
from other palace gardens.

31:48.790 --> 31:50.070
It's where palace eunuchs

31:50.070 --> 31:51.670
recover before their death.

31:51.750 --> 31:52.920
Ordinary people are not allowed here,

31:52.920 --> 31:54.050
hence it's guarded.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.590
Xia Jingyan deliberately humiliates

31:58.590 --> 31:59.480
Your Highness.

31:59.920 --> 32:00.510
Shut up.

32:03.550 --> 32:05.750
But this place has been uninhabited
for years.

32:05.750 --> 32:07.410
My lady, please don't mind it.

32:16.310 --> 32:17.170
Your Highness.

32:17.960 --> 32:18.480
Please.

32:52.000 --> 32:53.530
Be careful, Your Highness.

32:54.830 --> 32:55.880
Are you alright, Your Highness?

32:55.880 --> 32:56.590
Did you twist your ankle?

32:56.590 --> 32:57.450
My foot is fine.

32:57.960 --> 32:59.090
I was just careless.

33:02.160 --> 33:02.880
How can they let His Highness

33:02.880 --> 33:04.280
stay in a place like this?

33:04.830 --> 33:05.510
I'm afraid there isn't even

33:05.510 --> 33:07.000
a clean table or chair.

33:07.790 --> 33:09.390
Don't worry, Your Highness.

33:09.510 --> 33:11.110
Our conditions in the military

33:11.110 --> 33:12.710
were much harsher than this.

33:13.110 --> 33:14.720
You needn't worry about His Highness.

33:14.720 --> 33:16.000
He's just going in to see

33:16.000 --> 33:17.350
if it has been tidied up yet.

33:17.350 --> 33:18.680
We'll wait for him here.

33:41.550 --> 33:43.080
Your Highness, please sit.

33:55.880 --> 33:56.740
Your Highness.

33:57.510 --> 33:59.350
Shouzhe has finally waited

33:59.350 --> 34:00.360
for your return.

34:16.630 --> 34:17.550
Looking at his condition,

34:17.550 --> 34:18.730
I fear he won't last through the night.

34:18.730 --> 34:19.730
Who can blame him?

34:20.030 --> 34:21.480
He broke Her Majesty's

34:21.480 --> 34:22.550
favorite vase.

34:49.440 --> 34:50.370
All these years,

34:51.710 --> 34:52.969
you've suffered much.

34:53.590 --> 34:54.320
Please rise.

34:56.800 --> 34:57.730
I didn't suffer.

34:58.280 --> 34:59.320
I am now

34:59.840 --> 35:01.470
the Emperor's head eunuch.

35:01.510 --> 35:03.230
I can act freely. No one dares to stop me.

35:03.230 --> 35:04.440
If Your Highness has any requests,

35:04.440 --> 35:06.100
please don't hesitate to ask.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.670
Following your instructions,

35:07.670 --> 35:08.510
I didn't accompany Your Highness

35:08.510 --> 35:09.630
to Pingling.

35:10.000 --> 35:11.400
Every day I've been here,

35:12.590 --> 35:13.110
I've been waiting

35:13.110 --> 35:14.190
for your return.

35:15.150 --> 35:17.400
During these years I've been away
from the capital,

35:17.400 --> 35:18.400
there were indeed many matters

35:18.400 --> 35:20.200
that required your assistance.

35:20.320 --> 35:22.250
But you must be extremely careful.

35:22.360 --> 35:24.880
Xia Jingyan is cunning and ruthless.

35:25.110 --> 35:25.960
We absolutely cannot let him

35:25.960 --> 35:27.020
suspect anything.

35:27.070 --> 35:27.870
I understand.

35:28.280 --> 35:30.000
Since learning of your return,

35:30.000 --> 35:31.320
I've copied these documents

35:31.320 --> 35:32.430
and kept them ready.

35:32.430 --> 35:34.960
I'm sure Your Highness will find them useful.

35:39.730 --> 35:41.530
[Xia Jingyan’s Daily Chronicle]

35:41.000 --> 35:41.600
This is...

35:42.710 --> 35:44.510
Xia Jingyan’s Daily Chronicle?

35:47.110 --> 35:48.020
With this,

35:48.790 --> 35:51.170
Xia Jingyan will have no secrets from me.

35:53.700 --> 35:58.730
[Wutong Mansion]

35:57.220 --> 35:59.480
Murong Yao has people watching closely.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.360
I can't act rashly.

36:24.110 --> 36:24.920
I've been

36:24.920 --> 36:25.880
a pampered prince since childhood.

36:25.880 --> 36:27.550
I've never led troops nor fought in battle.

36:27.550 --> 36:28.280
His Majesty has passed the command

36:28.280 --> 36:29.320
of the Imperial Guards to me.

36:29.320 --> 36:30.980
Isn't that asking for my life?

36:31.320 --> 36:32.170
Do you know

36:32.360 --> 36:35.290
what it means
to live in complete darkness?

36:36.670 --> 36:38.950
She didn't see the sun for half a year.

36:39.230 --> 36:40.510
During those six months,

36:40.510 --> 36:42.920
if a few rats had gotten in,

36:43.440 --> 36:45.980
she would have been grateful to me.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.550
What are you thinking about?

36:48.550 --> 36:49.760
You've been preoccupied the whole journey.

36:49.760 --> 36:52.020
You don't even respond when I talk to you.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.150
Your father fought battles his whole life.

36:54.150 --> 36:56.190
You're considered to be
from a military family.

36:56.190 --> 36:58.000
How hard can it be
for you to lead the Imperial Guards?

36:58.000 --> 36:59.590
You handle military affairs
as if having a meal.

36:59.590 --> 37:00.400
You're used to it.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.880
I've never endured such hardship.

37:01.880 --> 37:02.630
Every day when I open my eyes,

37:02.630 --> 37:03.800
I'm overwhelmed with military affairs.

37:03.800 --> 37:04.710
It's driving me crazy.

37:04.710 --> 37:06.510
I even wrote my resignation letter.

37:06.510 --> 37:07.960
But then His Majesty suddenly fell ill.

37:07.960 --> 37:09.360
I didn't even get a chance to resign.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.800
Before His Majesty wakes up,

37:10.800 --> 37:11.920
the Imperial Guards' duty

37:11.920 --> 37:13.710
is to ensure the palace's security.

37:13.710 --> 37:15.200
Don't neglect your duties

37:15.230 --> 37:16.320
by sneaking out again.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.650
You know me well enough,

37:17.710 --> 37:19.370
I can't stand being confined.

37:20.550 --> 37:21.150
How about

37:21.400 --> 37:23.600
you take charge of the Imperial Guards
for a few days?

37:23.600 --> 37:24.510
Until His Majesty wakes up,

37:24.510 --> 37:25.550
you'll stay in the palace.

37:25.550 --> 37:26.510
I'll send all matters
of the Imperial Guards

37:26.510 --> 37:27.360
to the palace.

37:27.880 --> 37:29.010
Handle them for you.

37:29.400 --> 37:29.710
I...

37:29.840 --> 37:30.230
Fine.

37:30.320 --> 37:31.580
I'll take that as a yes.

37:32.370 --> 37:33.360
You truly are my good brother.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.400
I knew you would help me.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.630
Don't push it too far.

37:37.800 --> 37:38.360
General.

37:39.670 --> 37:40.630
From now on, report all matters
about the Imperial Guards

37:40.630 --> 37:41.870
directly to him.

37:42.280 --> 37:43.630
Prime Minister Zhuang wants
to arrest Ling Feng,

37:43.630 --> 37:44.800
but Mr. Ma won't allow it.

37:44.800 --> 37:45.710
I'm afraid our Imperial Guards

37:45.710 --> 37:47.570
will clash with the Jinwu Guards.

37:55.110 --> 37:56.440
Are you threatening me?

37:56.880 --> 37:57.630
For him,

37:57.710 --> 37:58.630
you employ the Jinwu Guards

37:58.630 --> 37:59.900
to oppose me?

38:00.590 --> 38:01.520
I wouldn't dare.

38:01.960 --> 38:02.730
However,

38:02.760 --> 38:03.840
I must ensure

38:03.840 --> 38:05.600
Lord Ling remains unharmed.

38:06.110 --> 38:07.040
Only if he's safe

38:07.280 --> 38:08.680
can His Majesty be saved.

38:10.400 --> 38:11.230
What are you doing?

38:11.230 --> 38:11.890
Step aside.

38:27.110 --> 38:28.640
What's the meaning of this?

38:28.920 --> 38:30.590
How does it feel to have a knife

38:30.590 --> 38:31.480
at your throat?

38:32.360 --> 38:34.620
Making such jokes in the imperial palace

38:34.960 --> 38:36.630
seems inappropriate, doesn't it?

38:36.630 --> 38:38.110
In the imperial palace,

38:38.800 --> 38:40.720
who are you to tell me what to do?

38:41.150 --> 38:41.880
I merely want

38:41.880 --> 38:43.680
to ask Lord Ling some questions.

38:43.800 --> 38:45.760
This matter doesn't concern you.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.440
I brought him here

38:47.440 --> 38:48.630
to treat His Majesty.

38:48.630 --> 38:50.360
Anyone who dares to trouble him

38:50.480 --> 38:52.070
is opposing me.

38:57.190 --> 38:59.050
Your Highness, please calm down.

38:59.110 --> 39:00.280
It's because Lord Ling

39:00.280 --> 39:01.590
refuses to disclose

39:01.590 --> 39:02.710
His Majesty's condition.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.820
I've examined His Majesty's

39:04.850 --> 39:06.840
recent medication records

39:07.190 --> 39:10.520
and found the prescribed medicines
quite strange.

39:11.280 --> 39:12.670
What's strange about them?

39:12.670 --> 39:13.550
Speak clearly.

39:14.030 --> 39:15.610
The medicines recorded

39:15.760 --> 39:18.020
are all for treating mental exhaustion.

39:18.230 --> 39:20.510
If His Majesty's illness

39:20.510 --> 39:21.590
were caused by mental fatigue,

39:21.590 --> 39:22.880
he certainly wouldn't

39:22.880 --> 39:24.110
remain unconscious for so long.

39:24.110 --> 39:24.760
Moreover,

39:25.000 --> 39:26.360
with Lord Ling's medical skills,

39:26.360 --> 39:27.810
he should have already

39:27.880 --> 39:29.480
awakened His Majesty by now.

39:29.670 --> 39:30.920
Besides Mr. Ma,

39:31.280 --> 39:32.510
the last person His Majesty saw

39:32.510 --> 39:34.570
before falling unconscious was you.

39:34.710 --> 39:35.840
Shortly after that,

39:36.480 --> 39:38.360
you brought Lord Ling into the palace.

39:38.360 --> 39:39.190
He took over all matters

39:39.190 --> 39:41.250
regarding His Majesty's treatment.

39:42.230 --> 39:44.670
Yet His Majesty remains unconscious
for days.

39:44.670 --> 39:47.070
Now the entire court is asking me

39:47.590 --> 39:49.250
what happened to His Majesty.

39:49.840 --> 39:50.640
First Prince,

39:51.480 --> 39:52.230
tell me,

39:53.030 --> 39:54.880
how should I answer them?

39:56.960 --> 39:57.690
Zhuang Shen,

39:59.150 --> 40:00.750
what are you implying?

40:00.920 --> 40:02.550
I'm merely stating facts.

40:02.960 --> 40:03.630
Lord Ling,

40:04.070 --> 40:05.330
why are you so nervous?

40:05.630 --> 40:06.960
Are you feeling guilty?

40:08.360 --> 40:10.280
I don't usually see anyone at court

40:10.280 --> 40:12.410
care so much about His Majesty before.

40:12.710 --> 40:14.110
If anyone has questions,

40:14.510 --> 40:15.910
let them ask me directly.

40:16.440 --> 40:18.170
You're known as the Killer God.

40:18.710 --> 40:20.310
Who would dare question you?

40:23.710 --> 40:24.960
Are you all so eager to know

40:24.960 --> 40:26.820
what illness Feng Pingcheng has?

40:27.880 --> 40:28.810
Absolutely not!

40:28.840 --> 40:29.590
Absolutely not,

40:29.590 --> 40:30.280
Lord Ling!

40:31.400 --> 40:32.970
He has a terminal illness.

40:34.760 --> 40:35.890
It's incurable.

40:35.920 --> 40:37.520
Even gods couldn't save him.

40:38.960 --> 40:39.800
Last March,

40:39.800 --> 40:40.400
May the year before,

40:40.400 --> 40:41.920
October three years ago...

40:41.920 --> 40:43.460
I've lost count.

40:43.880 --> 40:45.550
If I hadn't been keeping him alive,

40:45.550 --> 40:47.080
he would have died long ago!

40:47.150 --> 40:47.840
Lord Ling.

40:47.960 --> 40:48.450
You...

40:48.480 --> 40:49.610
I'll say what I want.

40:51.670 --> 40:53.070
I don't owe you anything.

40:53.760 --> 40:55.710
Find whoever you want to treat him.

40:56.590 --> 40:57.650
I'm done with this.

41:06.550 --> 41:08.110
If anyone reveals

41:08.110 --> 41:09.570
what was discussed today,

41:09.710 --> 41:11.480
I will exterminate their entire family.

41:11.480 --> 41:12.000
Yes.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.030
Lord Ling.

41:18.640 --> 41:23.150
[Ning'an Hall]

41:20.400 --> 41:21.840
Those things you just said

41:21.840 --> 41:23.580
were just to fool them, right?

41:23.630 --> 41:24.630
All that talk about terminal illness

41:24.630 --> 41:25.960
was just to frighten them.

41:25.960 --> 41:26.760
Isn't that so?

41:34.320 --> 41:35.350
Impossible.

41:35.920 --> 41:37.800
What illness can't you cure?

41:38.440 --> 41:40.030
You're the master of Zhengnian Villa,

41:40.030 --> 41:41.630
the best doctor in the world.

41:41.710 --> 41:42.670
Even if others can't cure him,

41:42.670 --> 41:44.150
you must have a way to save him.

41:44.150 --> 41:46.080
Unfortunately, I'm just a mortal,

41:46.760 --> 41:47.670
not a god.

41:54.070 --> 41:56.250
When was the illness discovered?

41:56.360 --> 41:57.420
Fifteen years ago.

41:58.110 --> 41:59.000
Fifteen?

42:02.000 --> 42:04.090
He knew about his terminal illness

42:05.030 --> 42:07.350
fifteen years ago.

42:07.760 --> 42:08.560
That's right.

42:09.280 --> 42:09.760
One could say

42:09.760 --> 42:11.960
that every day for these fifteen years,

42:13.030 --> 42:14.070
your father has been living

42:14.070 --> 42:16.000
on the edge between life and death.

42:16.400 --> 42:18.130
Why didn't he tell me?

42:18.360 --> 42:19.990
You were still young then,

42:20.150 --> 42:21.400
and you resented him

42:21.400 --> 42:22.800
for your mother's death.

42:23.000 --> 42:24.330
He chose not to tell you.

42:24.880 --> 42:26.480
He must have had his reasons.

42:28.110 --> 42:29.510
I deliberately let Zhuang Shen and others
know

42:29.510 --> 42:30.630
for your own good.

42:30.880 --> 42:31.840
Otherwise they would definitely

42:31.840 --> 42:33.000
blame all of your father's illness

42:33.000 --> 42:34.150
on you.

42:34.400 --> 42:35.590
Your situation will be

42:35.590 --> 42:36.520
even worse then.

42:36.710 --> 42:37.790
What can I do?

42:38.400 --> 42:39.930
Is there any way to cure him?

42:40.320 --> 42:41.550
I don't even know

42:41.550 --> 42:42.630
what I should do.

42:44.630 --> 42:46.030
All these years, I've traveled everywhere

42:46.030 --> 42:47.920
trying to find a way to save your father.

42:47.920 --> 42:48.590
That's because

42:48.590 --> 42:49.630
I promised your mother

42:49.630 --> 42:50.800
to save him.

42:51.480 --> 42:53.740
It has nothing to do with Feng Pingcheng.

42:53.880 --> 42:56.140
Even though your mother has passed away,

42:56.920 --> 42:58.250
I would still do my best.

42:58.510 --> 42:59.880
But human ability has its limits,

42:59.880 --> 43:01.280
and fate has its course.

43:02.320 --> 43:04.410
I can only barely extend his life.

43:05.030 --> 43:06.960
I cannot find a way to save him.

43:07.800 --> 43:09.590
What about the place that saved Ning Fei?

43:09.590 --> 43:11.630
Does that place have a way to cure him?

43:11.630 --> 43:12.440
That place

43:13.000 --> 43:13.800
is the Storm Alliance

43:13.800 --> 43:15.130
founded by your mother.

43:16.110 --> 43:17.130
Mother?

43:17.190 --> 43:17.960
The people of the Storm Alliance

43:17.960 --> 43:19.000
hate Feng Pingcheng deeply

43:19.000 --> 43:20.590
because of your mother's death.

43:20.590 --> 43:22.230
Would they be willing to save him?

43:22.230 --> 43:23.550
Besides, your father is suffering from

43:23.550 --> 43:24.810
qi depletion illness.

43:25.360 --> 43:26.800
Even if they were willing to help,

43:26.800 --> 43:28.130
they couldn't save him.

43:28.360 --> 43:29.190
Lord Ling.

43:30.150 --> 43:32.160
I just learned this truth today.

43:32.590 --> 43:33.640
But I beg you.

43:33.920 --> 43:35.380
His Majesty needs you now.

43:36.510 --> 43:38.310
Please also fulfill the promise

43:38.510 --> 43:40.320
you made to Mother.

43:41.440 --> 43:42.710
As for those who doubt you,

43:42.710 --> 43:43.640
leave them to me.

43:43.800 --> 43:45.460
Please feel free to treat him.

43:45.670 --> 43:47.510
Consider this a personal plea from me.
